      <publication_year>2021</publication_year>
      <description>Table of Galileo SSI images used in the preparation of the image mosaic of 243 Ida.
The Ida image mosaic is a simple cylindrical projection, 7 pixels/degree. The center
of the image map is 0 longitude, 0 latitude. Longitude is measured EAST on Ida. The
Ida map has the highest resolution images on a low-pass filtered map of the lower
resolution images.  Black areas are those with unprojectable surfaces.</description>
    </Citation_Information>
